#!/bin/zsh
cd "$(dirname "$0")"
B=../../dress-v0.1/inputs/f00-base.png
R=../refs-v2
FR="Full-length shot, the whole body from boots to above the head, exactly the same framing and camera distance as the first image."
SAME="Same man, same face, same pose, same coverall with sleeves down to the wrists, same background."
./run.sh 01-helmet.png 4242 $B "The man from the first image now wears the white full-brim hard hat shown in the second and third images on his head. The hat is: a one-piece glossy white shell, a tall rounded dome with a raised centre rib running front to back and recessed shoulders on each side, and a low broad flat brim about 40 mm wide all the way round, slightly drooping at the edge with a thin rolled lip; four small rectangular notches on the shell wall just above the brim; no front peak, no logo, no vents. $FR $SAME" $R/aves-titan-av-841r-nv/front.png $R/aves-titan-av-841r-nv/three-quarter.png
./run.sh 02-glasses.png 4242 $B "The man from the first image now wears the safety glasses shown in the second image on his face. The glasses are: half-wrap sport style with a single continuous wrap-around grey lens, a dark smoked upper frame rail across the top of the lens, no lower frame, black nose bridge; thin frame, two-tone temple arms black near the hinge and bright green with a white AVES logo on the outer side, going straight back over the ears; dark grey lenses, not a visor. $FR $SAME" $R/av-sg30/side-three-quarter.png
./run.sh 03-earmuffs.png 4242 01-helmet.png "The man from the first image, wearing the white full-brim hard hat, now also wears the black helmet-mounted earmuffs shown in the second and third images. The earmuffs are: two glossy black ear cups, each with a wide green band around the outside and a green AVES logo on the outer face, each cup hanging from its own rigid black side arm that clips into the slot on the side of the hard hat, so the cups sit over his ears under the brim; no headband over the hat. $FR $SAME" $R/av-hm3093-cap-earmuffs/front.png $R/av-hm3093-cap-earmuffs/side.png
./run.sh 04-gloves.png 4242 $B "The man from the first image now wears the black rubber gauntlet gloves shown in the second and third images on both hands. The gloves are: matt black seamless one-piece rubber gauntlets with crinkled ridged texture over the fingers and hand, long gauntlet smoother, orange rolled cuff edge, AVES logo and marking on the gauntlet. The coverall sleeves stay down and the glove cuffs go over the sleeves. $FR $SAME" $R/hg-2230-rubber-neoprene-gloves/back-upright.png $R/hg-2230-rubber-neoprene-gloves/three-quarter.png
./run.sh 05-glasses-s23.png 23 $B "The man from the first image now wears the safety glasses shown in the second image on his face. The glasses are: half-wrap sport style with a single continuous wrap-around grey lens, a dark smoked upper frame rail across the top of the lens, no lower frame, black nose bridge; thin frame, two-tone temple arms black near the hinge and bright green with a white AVES logo on the outer side, going straight back over the ears; dark grey lenses, not a visor. $FR $SAME" $R/av-sg30/side-three-quarter.png
